Next time take a second to check whether it is a dwarf king or a MF.
If it's a MF using FoD or MM to kill it before it gets to you.  Or
teleport it away with the spell or a wand.  Or teleport yourself away
since you have TC.  You don't really need to geno MF's with all the
options you have.  Be sure to keep an ID'ed charged wand of fire in
your main inventory in case one is summoned next to you and you will be
ok.



