> 5) Any other advice before I go beyond the Castle?

Don't disintegrate anymore armor or kill gobs of chaotic creatures.
Put your BoH in a sack or oilskin bag to protect it from cursing.  Keep
your wands of cancellation in a separate sack away from your BoH.  If
you get the spell drain life you can drain one enchantment from a piece
of armor and get those +4's to +5's.  It's not necessary but you could
do it.  Learn teleport away if you haven't already.

